Rule 4 (tensor dimensions should be valid for reduction)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : 0 ≤ v_2[i] ∧ v_2[i] < ndim(v_1)
