Rule 5 (tensor shape dimension should not be zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : shape(v_1, v_2[i]) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 6 (tensor should have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0
